{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30948","headline":"谒梓潼张恶子庙 · 王铎","name":"谒梓潼张恶子庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"盛唐圣主解青萍，欲振新封济顺名。\n夜雨龙抛三尺匣，春云凤入九重城。\n劒门喜气随雷动，玉垒韶光待贼平。\n惟报关东诸将相，柱天功业赖阴兵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王铎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30948.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30948","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}